    {
      "id": "293:p1",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:66658:66660"
    },
    {
      "id": "293:p2",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "你爬出浴缸，打开浴室门，冲进小屋。在你身后，陌生人正挤过窗框，发出咕噜咕噜的声音。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:66660:66703"
    },
    {
      "id": "293:p3",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "他就要进来了！\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:66703:66712"
    },
    {
      "id": "293:p4",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "抬起头，你看到眼前的门开着。没有什么挡着你的路。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:66712:66738"
    },
    {
      "id": "293:p5",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "要跑出门外，转到 298。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:66738:66753"
    },
    {
      "id": "293:p6",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "要寻找与陌生人搏斗的武器，转到 245。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:66753:66775"
    }
  ]
}
